pplications.md","line":30},{"title":"Deployment analyzer in ReleaseOps","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/application-development/deployment-analyzer.md","line":32},{"title":"REST API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-apis/api-rest.md","line":34},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":123},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":148},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":390},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":415},{"title":"Supported REST API headers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":706},{"title":"REST API HTTP response codes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/rest-api-explorer/c_RESTAPI.md","line":731}],"metadata":{"title":"ATF Code Coverage API","description":"The ATF Code Coverage API provides endpoints to compute code coverage from Automated Test Framework \\(ATF\\) runs. Coverage can be retrieved by filtered line numbers, for specific script IDs, or for all scripts covered by a set of test suite/test runs.Aggregates coverage across all scripts covered by the provided ATF runs. Supports combining test suite runs and individual test runs.Computes coverage for specific script records.Computes code coverage using a set of filtered line numbers per metadata record.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/rest-apis/atf-code-coverage-api.html","release":"australia","product":"REST APIs","classification":"rest-apis","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":15,"breadcrumb":["REST API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#rest","#table-api","#json","#http","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[259,271],[275,289],[546,559],[563,571],[668,676],[874,891],[895,907]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/rest-apis/atf-code-coverage-api.md"},
